Package: MacroSignals
Type: Package
Title: Vintage-Aware Macro Signal Research Toolkit
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("MacroSignals", "Research", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "research@macrosignals.local")
Description: A point-in-time macro research pipeline. It ingests vintage-aware
    macro releases, FX spot and carry, government bond futures and equity index
    proxies into a SQLite store, validates the data with a publication gate,
    builds cross-sectional carry, momentum and macro-surprise signals, and
    backtests them with transaction costs. Results feed a parameterised R
    Markdown report and an Excel/VBA desk front end.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
